  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3603.04 Caller Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3603.04 Caller Information. Any person who utilizes the toll-free hotline to report drug activity shall be asked for the following information:\n\n(a) Whether the activity is taking place within a school zone, and if so, the name of the school zone;\n\n(b) Whether the caller wishes to remain anonymous, and if not, the name, address, and telephone number of the caller;\n\n(c) Name, address, and telephone number of the individual who may be possessing, manufacturing, selling, dispensing, or possessing with an intent to sell, any controlled drug or analog, if known;\n\n(d) Physical description of the individual who may be possessing, manufacturing, selling, dispensing, or possessing with an intent to sell, any controlled drug or analog; and\n\n(e) Any other information the caller may wish to report.\n\nSource. #5382, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6703, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8553, eff 1-26-06; ss by #10591, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14008, eff 6-25-24",
